<title>USA: Stephan Co Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Stephan Co Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>FT. LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>THE STEPHAN CO.</p>
<p>					    QTR			ENDED</p>
<p>				 Mar 31, 1997		Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p> SALES			   $6,400,000		  $6,740,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME		     1,226,000		   1,219,000</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE		   .30			   .30</p>
<p>The decline in first quarter sales was due primarily to a one-time non recurring sale, of approximately $325,000, to the United States Armed Forces in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
